{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff2af5a2-4501-8680-a0d1-ee9b668d3165",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T15:00:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:57:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hello. This is Dulce Gomes. I am calling about [pause] noise. Landscaping noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, you're on speaker, I think. Can you tell me a little more about the noise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am on speaker, my hands are full. A leaf blower. A leaf blower, and the mowers and the trimmers, the whole crew, on a Sunday. Yesterday. Starting very early."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yesterday being Sunday. And that's the day after the nor'easter came through, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:57:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the storm was Saturday into Sunday. So I understand there is cleanup. I do. But this was not only cleanup. This was [pause] hours. Hours of blowing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And is this a one-time thing, or has it happened before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has been going on since Monday. Since last Monday. Every day, some part of the day, there is a machine running next door. Every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so about a week now. Let me get the location. What's the address where you are?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 285 Harrison Avenue. On the Fort Adams side. [line breaks up] the house next to me is the one that hires them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up a little there. Two eighty-five Harrison Avenue, and it's the neighbor's property that has the crew. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Correct. The neighbor's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Okay, I'll write that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, my question. Should I be calling the police? The non-emergency line. Instead of you? I do not know which one is [pause] right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, for noise happening right at the moment, the police non-emergency line is usually the one people use, since they can send someone out. What I can do here is take down your complaint so it's on record with the city. You can do both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Okay. That is fine. I just want it written down somewhere. Honestly, I did not expect this. The holidays, they sneak up on us every year, and I thought, well, the noise will calm down after. It did not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Yeah, things do pile up. So I've got your name as Dulce Gomes, and the number for a callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-one. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:59:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll pass this along as a repeated Sunday and daily landscaping noise complaint at two eighty-five Harrison. Someone from the office should follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would appreciate that. Really [pause] appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Ms. Gomes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T15:00:16-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
